d":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-yuanqigui-ws2288359"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001","text":"文帝袁皇后諱齊媯，陳郡陽夏人，左光祿大夫敬公湛之庶女也。母本卑賤，后年五六歲，方見舉。後適太祖，初拜宜都王妃。生子劭、東陽獻公主英娥。上待后恩禮甚篤，袁氏貧薄，后每就上求錢帛以贍與之，上性節儉，所得不過三五萬、三五十匹。後潘淑妃有寵，愛傾後宮，咸言所求無不得，后聞之，欲知信否，乃因潘求三十萬錢與家，以觀上意，信宿便得。因此恚恨甚深，稱疾不復見上。上每入，必他處回避。上數掩伺之，不能得。始興王濬諸庶子問訊，后未嘗視也。后遂憤恚成疾。元嘉十七年，疾篤，上執手流涕問所欲言，后視上良久，乃引被覆面。崩于顯陽殿，時年三十六。上甚相悼痛，詔前永嘉太守顏延之為哀策，文甚麗。其辭曰：","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"齊媯","person_id":"3tt_4ey_uti_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本段具名或具姓人物為袁齊媯。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"湛","person_id":"3tt_4ey_uti","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本段具名或具姓人物為袁湛。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"劭","person_id":"fof_k8v_7md","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本段具名或具姓人物為宋元凶劭。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"英娥","person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本段具名或具姓人物為東陽獻公主。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:u0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"袁氏","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"皇后本家共稱。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"潘","person_id":"8ge_4zd_66p","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"姓潘，以淑妃稱此人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0141","start":141,"end":142,"surface":"潘","person_id":"8ge_4zd_66p","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"承前潘淑妃，姓氏省稱。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0197","start":197,"end":198,"surface":"濬","person_id":"3b1_39e_aa6","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本段具名或具姓人物為始興王濬。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:u0198","start":198,"end":201,