1c1a853d2a891d46d6c1448b1","source_layer":"received_biography","editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui","book_id":"b-songshu-041","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-041-yuanqigui-ws2634831"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003","text":"典筆吏取筆不如意，鞭五十。子倩，尚文帝第四女海鹽公主。初，始興王濬以潘妃之寵，故得出入後宮，遂與公主私通。及適倩，倩入宮而怒，肆詈搏擊，引絕帳帶。事上聞，有詔離婚，殺主所生蔣美人，伯符慚懼發病卒。諡曰肅。傳國至孫勗，齊受禪，國除。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":15,"last_line":15,"raw_start":861,"raw_end":976,"raw_character_offsets":[861,862,863,864,865,866,867,868,869,870,871,872,873,874,875,876,877,878,879,880,881,882,883,884,885,886,887,888,889,890,891,892,893,894,895,896,897,898,899,900,901,902,903,904,905,906,907,908,909,910,911,912,913,914,915,916,917,918,919,920,921,922,923,924,925,926,927,928,929,930,931,932,933,934,935,936,937,938,939,940,941,942,943,944,945,946,947,948,949,950,951,952,953,954,955,956,957,958,959,960,961,962,963,964,965,966,967,968,969,970,971,972,973,974,975],"revision_id":2118581},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"倩","kind":"person","person_id":"r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"濬","kind":"person","person_id":"3b1_39e_aa6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"倩","kind":"person","person_id":"r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"倩","kind":"person","person_id":"r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"伯符","kind":"person","person_id":"r5n_x7v_cwf_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"勗",